			<div class="content" id="post-content-3892799">
									

<p>The article is a rewrite of <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-343">SCP-CN-343</a> (which is also written by me). I know my English is flawed but this is all I can do.. Thank you for reading such a long article.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Image&nbsp;source</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dragon Icon:<br />
Made by myself. Subject to CC-BY-SA 3.0</p>
<p>Image of -1:<br />
<a href="http://source.pixite.co/jamesmgrote/digital-landscapes?photo=My7Y28j8dGAp5ysvF">http://source.pixite.co/jamesmgrote/digital-landscapes?photo=My7Y28j8dGAp5ysvF</a><br />
James Grote, Public Domain</p>
<p>Image of bathmetry:<br />
<a href="http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/mgg/image/2minrelief.html">http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/mgg/image/2minrelief.html</a> , NOAA, Public Domain</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Some settings about the <em>Smoke</em> comes from <a href="/oria-001">ORIA Memorandum 001</a>, which I tried to integrate into the world view of this SCP. If the author does not like what is going on with their work here I would happily remove the part regarding to the Smoke.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Easters&nbsp;eggs&nbsp;and&nbsp;thoughts&nbsp;(spoilers&nbsp;inside)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>File 4000/031 - Yes, this is the war in heavens as described in <em>Bible</em>. The deputy resembles the &quot;beast&quot; to whom the dragon gave his authority. And they somehow &quot;healed from fatal wound&quot; and &quot;gave people markings&quot;.</p>
<p>File 4000/032 matches the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Flood_(China)">Gun-Yu Legend</a>.</p>
<p>The &quot;primitive electricity generators for thaumaturgic purposes&quot; may or may not be <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baghdad_Battery">Baghdad Battery</a>._.</p>
<p>And the Azores / City of Orders? Its location somehow coincides with Plato's description of Atlantis, and I am surprised to find out that it also coincides with that of Mount Buzhou in Chinese legends. To be short, according to legends, it was a mountain that supported the heavens, and when a heavenly war broke out, the mountain was smashed. As a result, skys fell and and earth cracked, causing a great flood.</p>
<p>The Unseen is originally an Islamic theological concept (الغيب, secrets known only to Allāh, sometimes considered to be related with magic and future-telling), but in this skip, the concept may have different meanings.</p>
<p>I always wonder what happened in those very ancient times. According to <em>Book of Shang</em>(尚书) and <em>Book of History</em>(史记)(both are history recorded by court officials in ancient China), ancient emperors before the flood (~4000 years ago) lived very, very long life(&gt;100). Legends say they can command magical creatures. Then I figure out that human, as described in <em>Bible</em>, can live 120 years before the flood. When I brainstormed this skip I thought about the legends. What if they are true? What if ancient civillizations and prehistoric civillizations are much more advanced than us?</p>
<p>Though flood myth exists among various cultures, the time that a flood occurred is inconsistent. At first I cannot make a proper time setting, and then I come up with the idea that end of the world has happened many times before. The <em>Qur'an</em> also mentioned that there are &quot;generations and generations We destroyed before you&quot;, and, here it is.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Many thanks to:<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/motthery" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720398); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3720398&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1558462914" alt="MottHery" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3720398)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/motthery" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720398); return false;">MottHery</a></span><br />
